Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteenth Episode\NThe Castle of Roses
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I'm doing nothing\Nbut getting bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, the\Ntroops are already lined up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that at\Nten you must review them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You are already late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You must fulfill your duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here is a towel for you!\N- Hurry up! Make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers, attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Present arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see, Opal? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Prince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness is leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move!\NWe managed to slip away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Your Highness!\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am by no means obliged\Nto tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish. I only hope\Nyou don't have in mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...to go to the Southern Valley.\N- Why can't I go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There are often\Nlandslides. It is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.74,0:03:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow him! And see\Nif he enters the valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am at the crossroads!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I love risk, I will go to\Nthe left, into the Southern Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So many roses...! Who could\Nhave thrown them on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an interesting place, I don't\Nsee any threat of landslides.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Duralumin\Nwanted to warn me..!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent, that castle\Noverlooking the whole valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What are you doing, you idiots?!\NPut the tent back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Commander!\NRaise the tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness he had already passed,\Notherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful! Let's go in! Do you want to, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, little horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Don't you want to go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy! Come on, easy!\NThis is no time to act up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?\NIt's only an old castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special!\NEasy! What's wrong, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- And who are you?\N- Your name is Sapphire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed! And I am a Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are a real Prince?!\N- Yes, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell me, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we will meet again, Prince.\NNow please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't go away!\NAt least tell me your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.78,0:05:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.\NIt seemed as if she vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell a wonderful scent of roses
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No passing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could that be? Better go see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he manage to get in?\NCome forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to fetch you, Your Highness,\Nto take you to the castle of the roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent name for a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell again\Nthat strange scent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The carriage is heading\Nto the Valley of the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am curious to see\Nwhere we will end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You may step down, Your\NHighness. We have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enchanting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask where I am and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The carriage has disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it have\Nmanaged to leave so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone wants me to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange place...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What beautiful statues!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why those two roses...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, how do I get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And these other two?\NHow big they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, they look like\Nrose-shaped boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please get onto the boat\Nof the white rose. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And what will happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Welcome, Your Highness.\N- Ah, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Duke of the White Roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask you why\Nyou had me come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will explain it to you right away, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:10:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that, centuries ago, my ancestors\Nbuilt the home you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of my lineage\Nhave always lived here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,one generation after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But for some time now,\Nsomeone has been trying...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...to drive me\Nand my family away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, Prince Sapphire,\Ngive us a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please try to help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not want to abandon\Nour ancient home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we could not live\Nanywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could this unworthy person be\Nwho is trying to drive you away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- It is Grand Duke Duralumin.\N- Duralumin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, take courage!\NDamned Grand Duke..!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I promise you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.62,0:10:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, brother: I don't\Ntrust this Prince very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You could be\Nmore polite, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, excuse my brother,\Nthe Duke of the Red Roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have thought about our\Nproblem. As for me, I am tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...of living in this land, where\Nnothing but weeds grow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:11:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore I propose to leave\Nit to Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you dare betray\Nthe memory of your ancestors..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the land that gave you\Nbirth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you want,\Nbut I don't care at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already decided to give\Nthis land to the Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We will go where there\Nwon't be all these weeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we'll be better off!\N- You are a wretch, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!\NYou are brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.14,0:11:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you had better not\Nstick your nose into our business,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,or we will spread\Nyour secret around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, it is truly despicable\Nto reveal other people's secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care! After all, you too\Nknow the Prince's secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the power to discover\Nall the secrets of human beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What secret are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That you are a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you are my brother,\NI cannot tolerate...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...that in front of me\Nanyone behaves like a scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,On guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Will you stop it?!\N- What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.74,0:12:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, Prince! Escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hornets, sting Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sting, hornets!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll teach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Sapphire!\N- Let that be a lesson to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I will heal you, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps...\NPerhaps it was all a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, try to help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But then...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent! The range of our\Nweapons from this fortress is excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If this fortification\Nis added to the rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be easy for us\Nto destroy the neighboring country.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, finally, we can lay\Nour hands on this rich territory
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...that borders ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Put up the tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the cannon away!\NHurry up with the operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Operation camouflage!\NWe mustn't be seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Away, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! Out with the cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the gun ports!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not like running\Non the gun carriage! Stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:14:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!\NWhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Prince! I received word\Nthat there had been a landslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem to me that there have been\Nany landslides.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth:\Nwhat drove you to come all the way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely nothing special,\NYour Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? The Duke of the White Roses,\Nowner of this territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,told me that you are trying\Nto take his castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the annexed Duchy!\N- Duke of the White Roses,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,his castle..\NBut what are you talking about, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you know nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, there is no castle\Nin this valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only that abandoned castle\Non that rocky spur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around: do you see the\Ncastle of this Duke of the Roses?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps last night\Nyou dreamed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly strange!\NYet I went inside
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic, Grand Duke!\NYou always manage to fool him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you shouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They are still working\Nup there! He will notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They are roses! What\Nare you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapons for the\Nfortification, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? A fortification?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Duralumin is preparing an\Nattack on the neighboring country!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to stop and\Nnot to cut the flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not ruin this\Ncountry to prepare for war!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire prefers flowers\Nto war! That damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The tower is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a landslide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back among us, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.14,0:18:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look around,\Nyou will see my companions..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...defeated by the Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.66,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you pouring water\Non their wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Water is the best medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Water, a medicine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend! Poor little flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand! So you are\Nthe spirits of the flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are the spirits of the flowers\Nof the Southern Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the spirit\Nof the white rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My followers are weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have taken on human form\Nto speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands of us are trampled\Nevery day by Grand Duke Duralumin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,who has the absurd ambition\Nto wage war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor flower,\Nwhat they have reduced you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Rally your friends!\NWe will defeat Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire! I don't care\Nif the weeds have to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you shut up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I, spirit of the red rose,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,have decided to settle\Nin Duralumin's abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I will enjoy the\Npeace of his sunny garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you care about what\Nwill happen to the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If the weeds are destroyed, I\Nwill have more land for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are a scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hornets, sting Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!\NThey are too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will try to stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But this hornet is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let myself be overwhelmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And this! And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab the carriage, Prince!\NQuick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't make it\Nwith that monstrous hornet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The hornet keeps following us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back, you nasty beast! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit it! I order you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you come within my reach,\NI'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up, Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke of the Red Roses?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.50,0:22:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This boy was telling me something\N...very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It is something that concerns you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he was just telling me\Nthat he is willing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...to testify in public\Nthat you, Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.78,0:22:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,are a girl!\NAnd you can be sure he will do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,unless...\NWhat are your conditions?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.94,0:22:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I cannot live\Nany longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.06,0:22:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like you to plant\Nthis rose in your garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so that my family\Ncan survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of proposal is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to believe\Nthat you're mocking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know who I am! I am\Nthe brother of the King of Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as Minister of Police!\NE dovrei piantare nel mio giardino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,..questo misero fiore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.02,0:22:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dove diavolo è sparito\Nil mio testimone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.14,0:22:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Granduca Duralumin,\Nora mi spiegherete della fortezza!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.78,0:22:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Beh, vi dirò, Principe..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho costruito quella fortezza\Nper difendere la nostra terra,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- cioè il vostro regno.\N- Otterrò da mio padre...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.18,0:23:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,..il permesso di distruggerla!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.94,0:23:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Questa terra\Nnon ha bisogno di fortezze!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio caro Duca,\Nalmeno voi state bene!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Why?\NWhat happened to my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.42,0:23:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.62,0:23:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be sad, my dear Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will destroy that fortress
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you can live\Nhappily in the Southern Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,On behalf of my companions,\NI thank you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The flower spirits and I will never\Nforget your kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell! And be happy!
